# Butler Routes - Durotar rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 6 rank-flagged rares of Durotar
# (zone key 1411), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever npc/object/item dumps). Every goal is optional - a
# missing spawn never wedges the guide. Five rares hold multiple
# points and loop them; Death Flayer holds a single Durotar point and
# gets a plain single-goto step. None of the six carries signature
# loot in the data: every recipe on their tables is a 400-570-zone
# generic world drop (the recipes companion does not list zone
# content among them), and Death Flayer's Venomtail Poison Sac serves
# only a repeatable out-of-contract quest - so no collect goals ride
# the rare steps. No tame lines ship: no family flag exists in NPC
# records and the core guide never kills these beasts' kin (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Treasures ride one loop over the 24
# fixed Battered Chest points plus their own steps for the 5 unique
# rune objects. No accept/turnin lines anywhere - the core guide owns
# every quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/durotar-rares
title Durotar - Rares & Treasures
levels 1-13
zone Durotar
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords durotar, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step Tiragarde Keep side - Warlord Kolkanis

  zone map 1411

  loop
  goto 46.43,79
  goto 47.88,77.37
  goto 49.88,80.6
  kill 5808 optional
  note Warlord Kolkanis (level 9 rare elite) walks three points on the Tiragarde Keep side. No unique loot recorded - ordinary greens and generic world-drop patterns only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Echo Isles side - Watch Commander Zalaphil

  zone map 1411

  loop
  goto 59.23,58.52
  goto 59.93,59.02
  kill 5809 optional
  note Watch Commander Zalaphil (level 9 rare elite) walks two points on the Echo Isles side. He is an Alliance-faction commander - hostile to Horde players, killable. No unique loot recorded - ordinary greens only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North pass - Felweaver Scornn

  zone map 1411

  loop
  goto 51.68,9.59
  goto 52.78,8.96
  goto 53.05,7.25
  kill 5822 optional
  note Felweaver Scornn (level 11 rare) walks three points at the north pass. No unique loot recorded - ordinary greens and generic world-drop patterns only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Southwest flats - Death Flayer

  zone map 1411

  goto 36.53,49.67
  kill 5823 optional
  note Death Flayer (level 11 rare elite) holds a single point on the southwest flats. It also spawns in the Barrens (covered by the Barrens companion). Its Venomtail Poison Sac serves only a repeatable out-of-contract quest, so it rides no collect goal here.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

