step Skull Rock side - Buried Treasure

  zone map 1411

  goto 62.1,94.8
  collect 203991 "Rune of Quick Draw" optional
  note Buried Treasure holds a single point on the Skull Rock side. The Rune of Quick Draw has no quest use anywhere in the data - bank it or use it per your class.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

